  "ruleText": "Puc 1801.02 “Application” means application EC-1, dated March, 2015 forms, plans and specifications, compliance materials, and any additional material submitted to the commission or local authority having jurisdiction, as applicable, for review for compliance with the energy code.\n\nSource. #6879, eff 2-1-99, EXPIRED: 2-1-07\n\nNew. #8811, INTERIM, eff 2-2-07, EXPIRED: 8-1-07\n\nNew. #8958, eff 7-31-07, EXPIRED: 7-31-15\n\nNew. #10908, eff 8-8-15",
